#[[
@file Serialization functions for various data formats.

### Functions:
```
function serialize.int ... end # Serialize a 32-bit integer to a 4-byte string.
```
#]]

#[[
@export
@brief Serialize a 32-bit integer to a 4-byte string.
@param value number The integer to serialize.
@return string A string of 4 bytes.
#]]
function serialize.int
	return {
		(
			char(i) for i in @1.bytes(4).reverse()
		).join("")
	}
end
